INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (2,'Golden strap','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/golden_strap.webp','This bag is a leather bag with gold straps that is suitable for women who want to have luxury and beautiful bags.',800,38,'Handbag','Leather','Best Sellers'),(3,'Medallion','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/medallion.webp','A top-handle bag designed to be worn from morning to night. Perfect for the modern woman who needs a practical bag but doesn’t want to sacrifice glamour.',950,12,'Handbag','Leather','Highest Quality'),(4,'Catbird Home','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/catbird_home.webp','A brand new, limited edition tote to celebrate our 16th Anniversary. Our tote bags are 100% GOTS (Global Organic Textile Standard) Certified.',920,17,'Tote','Leather','Newest'),(5,'Cord Tote','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/cord_tote.webp','Your new \'take to the cafe\' tote bag.\nJoin the Korean tote bag trend... throw in your laptop + some books and head off for a day of study, relaxation and (of course) coffee.',870,55,'Tote','Leather','Best Sellers'),(6,'The dUCk','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/the_dUCk.webp','This one’s a keeper! You’ll never forget to bring your own bag when it looks this cool. Upgraded with an inner pocket, you can keep small valuables within hand’s reach in the dUCk Shopping Bag.',780,142,'Shopping','Leather','Highest Quality'),(7,'Folding Pull','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/folding_pull.webp','Folding Shopping Pull Cart Trolley Bag With Wheels Foldable Shopping Bags Reusable Grocery Bags Food Organizer Vegetables Bag.',800,74,'Shopping','Leather','Highest Quality'),(8,'Roosevelt Buffalo','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/roosevelt_buffalo.webp','Our dark oak brown Roosevelt Buffalo Leather Satchel is expertly crafted from water buffalo hide. At 17” long and 13” high, This men\'s leather satchel bag is designed with padded space for a 15” laptop, extra storage under the flap, and organizers for various pens and small accessories.',820,54,'Satchel','Leather','Newest'),(9,'Mahi','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/mahi.webp','Whilst both bags are used by men and women, the Messenger has become a youthful substitute for the briefcase and is now worn by men and women in a business context. The satchel has a slightly more quirky and nostalgic image, often accentuated in contemporary designs by the use of brightly coloured leather.',750,44,'Satchel','Leather','Best Sellers'),(10,'Suede','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/suede.webp','Super soft personalised suede leather clutch bag in a rainbow of beautiful colours and personalised with your choice of engraved initials or message.',850,42,'Clutch','Leather','Newest'),(11,'Fashion Clutch','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/fashion_clutch.webp','Fashion women\'s envelope clutch bag High quality Crossbody Bags for women trend handbag messenger bag large Ladies Clutches.',900,20,'Clutch','Leather','Highest Quality'),(12,'E90 BACKPACK','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/e90_backpack.webp','Introducing our first ever backpack, created in collaboration with accessory experts WANT Les Essentiels. The cornerstone of the Cardinal Collection, the water-resistant E90 Backpack is generously designed to carry all your everyday essentials securely. It also features straps that allow the N00 Jacket to be stowed away effortlessly, and a D-ring to secure the S180 Cap when not in use.',600,30,'Backpack','Leather','Newest'),(13,'Louis','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/louis.webp','Glance on any commuter train these days and something is confirmed anew: backpacks are the new briefcases. Over the years, the rucksack, or knapsack, has slowly taken over from the more venerable case, especially in more casual work environments. In one sense this is logical, yet another sign of sportswear’s encroachment of the working wardrobe.',600,34,'Backpack','Leather','Newest'),(14,'Purses','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/purses.webp','If you don\'t need to carry a lot, but you have more than your pockets can handle, a purse with a built-in wallet could be your organizational dream come true. They\'re typically small and make things easy to find, plus you won\'t have the extra weight or cost of a separate wallet to deal with.',700,84,'Wallet','Leather','Best Sellers'),(15,'Cross Body','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/crossBody.webp','Street style fashion details, tanned woman wearing linen shorts, white shirt, brown leather bag and clear beige sunglasses, modern classic summer chic outfit, warm colors.',500,97,'Wallet','Leather','Most Visited'),(16,'Warp Sling Bag','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/warp_sling_bag.webp','The Warp Sling Bag merges all the functionality of a backpack with the on-trend styling of a crossbody. Made with CORDURA® fabrics that are recognized for their long-lasting durability and resistance to abrasion, tearing, and scuffs, this upgraded sling bag comes equipped with a padded tablet compartment that lets you safely store your device, a waffle mesh back panel for comfort, and a stretch water bottle pocket on the side.',600,43,'Sling','Leather','Most Visited'),(17,'City Sling','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/city_sling.webp','The compact City Sling is designed for exploring the city. It features multiple pockets to store your daily essentials and a versatile webbing strap for dual carry positions.',700,41,'Sling','Leather','Most Visited'),(18,'Elizabeth Large Bucket','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/elizabeth_large_bucket.webp','A practical handbag that doesn’t sacrifice style, the Elizabeth Small Crossbody Bucket Bag is the perfect companion for a day out. When you need just the essentials with you, the Elizabeth carries your phone, wallet, keys, and other small necessities.',850,69,'Bucket','Leather','Most Visited'),(19,'K/IKONIK','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/ikonik.webp','The K/Ikonik collection returns with playful artwork on sophisticated shapes. Introducing the leather bucket bag with detachable straps, to wear it your way. Ikonik Karl Lagerfeld artwork adds the finishing touch.',700,96,'Bucket','Leather','Best Sellers'),(20,'Puffer Oversized','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/puffer_oversized.webp','Preorder (1.5 weeks)\nDimensions: 40x39.5x22\nColours: Black and White\nWaterproof material and can fit a laptop',850,27,'Quilted','Leather','Most Visited'),(21,'Mod Squad','http://10.0.2.2/dunibazaar/uploads/mod_squad.webp','Add a pop of color to your OOTD with our chic green \'Mod Squad\' tote featuring sleek lightweight material with quilted texturing, an adjustable gold chain link and ribbon shoulder strap, an outside pack pouch, and a spacious rectangular silhouette with a flap and twist closure and additional inside pockets and compartments!',650,29,'Quilted','Leather','Highest Quality');
UNLOCK TABLES;

